              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-CRAB-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Still though, a darker power is at work, greater than any threat this world has seen. I fear that Morganthe has returned.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Thurston_Plunkett.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThurstonPlunkett_CEL_13.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225849,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-CRAB-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Before the cataclysm, she was refused Celestia’s magic, but now I fear we have inadvertently opened the door to her.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Thurston_Plunkett.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThurstonPlunkett_CEL_14.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225849,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-CRAB-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We haven’t much time! She must be stopped before she claims the secrets of Astral magic and seizes control of the Spiral!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Thurston_Plunkett.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThurstonPlunkett_CEL_15.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225849,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-CRAB-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You must get to the bottom of this revolt. I feel the Pisceans and the Lophians are her dupes. Go into their city if you can.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Thurston_Plunkett.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThurstonPlunkett_CEL_16.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225849,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-CRAB-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You should try to pay honor to their Emperor over there. Let him make some proclamations and feel important, will you?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Thurston_Plunkett.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThurstonPlunkett_CEL_17.mp3",
